  "body_html": "<h1>Ordered-Bid Utilities</h1>\n<p>For finite linearly ordered bid spaces, the auction library provides maximum\nbid, argmax bidder, and maximum-bid-excluding-one-bidder utilities.</p>\n<p>These utilities support concrete auction rules such as first-price and\nsecond-price auctions.</p>",
